OL,3,GNEWSAPartially collapsed car park
OL,4,Ademolition set to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to demolish a partially collapsed
OL,7,Fcar park in Mansfield is set to begin
OL,8,Fin the next few weeks.
OL,10,FThe top deck of the Walkden Street car
OL,11,Fpark, which has been shut since
OL,12,FFebruary 2024 due to safety concerns,
OL,13,Fsuffered "structural damage" at the end
OL,14,Fof August 2025.
OL,16,FMansfield District Council said in
OL,17,FSeptember 2025 inspections had shown a
OL,18,Ffull demolition of the site was needed
OL,19,F"to prevent any further risk to the
OL,20,Fpublic and to prevent any future
OL,21,Fcollapses".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
