OL,3,GNEWSAPartially collapsed car park
OL,4,Ademolition set to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority said on Friday - after
OL,7,Fagreements were completed with the
OL,8,Fleaseholder and the freeholder of the
OL,9,Fsite - demolition work was expected to
OL,10,Fbegin.
